---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';

---
<Base title="Free Static Website Terms" description="Terms for the complimentary static website: up to 5 pages, 1 round of revisions, hosted while at least one paid AI service is active.">
<div style="max-width:1296px;margin:0 auto;padding:clamp(32px,4vw,48px) clamp(24px,4vw,48px) clamp(48px,5.5vw,80px)">
<nav aria-label="Breadcrumb" style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px;font-size:14px;margin-bottom:clamp(32px,5vw,64px)"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="ms" aria-hidden="true" style="font-size:16px;color:#585E5A">chevron_right</span><span aria-current="page" style="color:#585E5A">Free Static Website Terms</span></nav>
<header style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;max-width:760px;margin-bottom:clamp(40px,6vw,64px)">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#1D6B60">Legal</p>
<h1 style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(34px,4vw,48px);line-height:1.15;letter-spacing:-0.025em;text-wrap:balance">Free Static Website Terms</h1>
<p style="font-size:clamp(17px,1.5vw,19px);line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633;text-wrap:pretty">Clients who subscribe to at least one paid AI Service get a static website of up to 5 pages, with 1 round of revisions, at no charge.</p>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;gap:8px 16px;font-size:15px;color:#585E5A"><span>Effective date: Oct 12, 2026</span></div>
</header>
<div style="display:flex;gap:clamp(40px,6vw,96px);align-items:flex-start">
<aside class="hide-lt960" style="flex:0 0 260px;position:sticky;top:104px;max-height:calc(100vh - 128px);overflow-y:auto"><nav aria-label="On this page" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2px">
<p style="font-weight:600;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#585E5A;padding:0 12px 8px">On this page</p>
<a class="x1" href="#f1" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">1. What's included</a>
<a class="x2" href="#f2" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">2. Not included</a>
<a class="x3" href="#f3" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">3. Client's part</a>
<a class="x4" href="#f4" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">4. Launch and changes</a>
<a class="x5" href="#f5" style="display:block;padding:8px 12px;border-radius:8px;font-size:15px;line-height:1.4;color:#2F3633;text-decoration:none">5. When AI Services end</a>
</nav></aside>
<article style="flex:1;min-width:0;max-width:760px;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:48px">
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">These terms apply to that website under Section 2.4 of our Master Services Agreement, and are attached to the Order Form that includes it.</p>
<section id="f1" aria-labelledby="f1-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="f1-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">1. What's included</h2>
<dl style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6">
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 24px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><dt style="flex:1 1 200px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">Pages</dt><dd style="flex:2 1 320px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Up to 5 (for example: Home, About, Services, FAQ, Contact)</dd></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 24px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><dt style="flex:1 1 200px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">Revisions</dt><dd style="flex:2 1 320px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">1 round of revisions, submitted in one consolidated list within 10 business days of the first draft</dd></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 24px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><dt style="flex:1 1 200px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">Type</dt><dd style="flex:2 1 320px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Static site: fixed pages, no logins, online store, booking engine or custom database</dd></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 24px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><dt style="flex:1 1 200px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">AI features</dt><dd style="flex:2 1 320px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">AI chat and voice can be added as part of a paid <a href="/ai-powered-website#compare">AI-Powered Website</a> Service</dd></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 24px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><dt style="flex:1 1 200px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">Hosting</dt><dd style="flex:2 1 320px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Included while at least one paid AI Service is active</dd></div>
<div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:4px 24px;padding:16px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #DED5C6"><dt style="flex:1 1 200px;font-weight:600;font-size:16px;line-height:1.5">Domain</dt><dd style="flex:2 1 320px;font-size:16px;line-height:1.6;color:#2F3633">Client registers and owns its domain; HazirMinds can connect it</dd></div>
</dl>
</section>

<section id="f2" aria-labelledby="f2-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="f2-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">2. Not included</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Extra pages, extra revision rounds, custom design, copywriting, photography, e-commerce, integrations and later content changes. These are quoted through a change order.</p>
</section>

<section id="f3" aria-labelledby="f3-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="f3-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">3. Client's part</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">Client provides its logo, text, images and business details, and confirms it has the right to use them. The build starts once HazirMinds receives them.</p>
</section>

<section id="f4" aria-labelledby="f4-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="f4-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">4. Launch and changes</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">The site launches after Client approves it, or 10 business days after the revised draft is delivered if Client sends no further comments. Changes after launch are billed through a change order.</p>
</section>

<section id="f5" aria-labelledby="f5-h" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px;scroll-margin-top:104px">
<h2 id="f5-h" style="font-weight:700;font-size:clamp(22px,2.2vw,26px);line-height:1.3;letter-spacing:-0.01em">5. When the AI Services end</h2>
<p style="font-size:17px;line-height:1.7;color:#2F3633">If Client ends all paid AI Services, Client keeps its website content and domain. HazirMinds will hand over the site files and help transfer the domain within 30 days. Hosting after handover is Client's responsibility (MSA Section 4.7).</p>
</section>

<div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px;padding-top:32px;border-top:1px solid #DED5C6"><p style="font-weight:600;font-size:15px">Other legal pages</p><div style="display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px 24px;font-size:16px"><a href="/privacy">Privacy Policy</a><a href="/terms">Terms of Use</a><a href="/ai-disclosure">AI Disclosure</a><a href="/accessibility">Accessibility Statement</a></div></div>
</article>
</div>
</div>

</Base>

<style>
.x1:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
.x2:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
.x3:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
.x4:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
.x5:hover{background:#F0EAE0 !important;color:#0F4C45 !important}
</style>
